                                "sense_id": "c52bd99d-6df4-3378-bbb3-2759f70e6c08",
                                "text": "Amharic for “honey wine,” tej is an Ethiopian drink that kings, queens, and other royals have enjoyed for thousands of years.[…]¶ Tej is an ancient, fermented spirit mostly made from raw honey, water, and wild yeast.[…]¶ They toasted each other with the tej she brought."
